The function `Backend::store` is a pure virtual function declared in the abstract `Backend` class in `/src/xrpld/nodestore/Backend.h.txt`. This function is part of the interface that all backend storage implementations in the Ripple NodeStore must provide. Below is a detailed, step-by-step explanation of how `Backend::store` is defined and how it is implemented in concrete backend classes, strictly based on the provided code and context.

